    "q-135317": {
      "dom_id": "step-q135317",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Find the inverse of the following matrix: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{5}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the given matrix is diagonal.\n\nThe inverse of a diagonal matrix can be found as follows: \n\n$$\n{[\\begin{aligned}{a}_{11} & 0 & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ 0 & {a}_{22} & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ 0 & 0 & ⋯ & {a}_{nn}\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{{a}_{11}} & 0 & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{{a}_{22}} & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ 0 & 0 & ⋯ & \\frac{1}{{a}_{nn}}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIn our case, we obtain\n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}={[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{5}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{2}{5} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{6} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-135317-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{2}{5} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{6} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
